    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<link rel="stylesheet" class="aplayer-secondary-style-marker" href="\assets\css\APlayer.min.css"><script src="\assets\js\APlayer.min.js" class="aplayer-secondary-script-marker"></script><html><head></head><body><span id="more"></span><meting-js server="netease" type="song" id="3340113701" mode="circulation" autoplay="false" mutex="false" listmaxheight="340px" preload="auto" theme="#ad7a86"></meting-js><h1><span id="%E5%80%9F%E5%8A%A9aigithubhexo%E6%90%AD%E5%BB%BA%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E6%97%A0%E9%9C%80%E8%B4%AD%E4%B9%B0%E6%9C%8D%E5%8A%A1%E5%99%A8%E9%9B%B6%E6%88%90%E6%9C%AC%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%AA%E4%BA%BA%E5%8D%9A%E5%AE%A2">借助AI+github+hexo搭建一个无需购买服务器+零成本的个人博客</span></h1><p><em><strong>借助豆包和grok或者谷歌的ai都能成功部署</strong></em></p><h3><span id="%E5%BD%93%E7%84%B6%E6%98%AF%E7%94%A8%E6%9D%A5%E8%AE%B0%E5%BD%95%E6%88%91%E6%89%80%E5%81%9A%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%8B%E6%83%85%E5%95%A6%E5%B0%B1%E8%AF%B4%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E6%97%A5%E8%AE%B0%E7%B0%BF">当然是用来记录我所做的事情啦，就说一个日记簿</span></h3><hr><p><img src="https://i.waifu.pics/8flhYEv.jpg"></p><h3><span id="2026-2-04"><em><strong>2026-2-04</strong></em></span></h3><h1><span id="%E5%88%A9%E7%94%A8zeabur%E6%88%90%E5%8A%9F%E9%83%A8%E7%BD%B2openlist%E7%9A%84webdav%E5%AE%9E%E7%8E%B0%E5%BF%AB%E6%8D%B7%E5%88%86%E4%BA%AB%E8%B5%84%E6%BA%90%E5%B0%86%E4%BC%9A%E5%9C%A8%E6%9C%AC%E7%AB%99%E6%8C%82%E8%BD%BD%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8">利用zeabur成功部署openlist的webdav，实现快捷分享资源。将会在本站挂载使用</span></h1></body></html>]]></content>
    
    
      
      
        
        
